number = 1856
title = "[Coherence] Tasks 22.39.119 and 22.39.120 now point their touches and gates at tests/agent/sdk/python, but their tests lists and capability blocks still name test files under services/agent/sdk/python/tests that do not exist"
revision = "3520b1428059af90261432778c008a9ce362a0b1"
verdict = "spec-edit"
evidence = "Tasks 22.39.120 and 22.39.119 are done (spec/layerx-merge/spec.kvx:352003 and spec/layerx-merge/spec.kvx:352034), but their tests lists (spec/layerx-merge/spec.kvx:352014 and spec/layerx-merge/spec.kvx:352045) and capability touches, tests and verification_contract fields (spec/layerx-merge/spec.kvx:44489 and spec/layerx-merge/spec.kvx:44498) still reference the former test locations despite the central-tree repairs in commits 5247adc56b93433fa7d8ad18a98455124a7e19df and 06d9fa865e929be081a8bddc1836c9ac8e384d48 and the remaining central-tree baseline nodeid at tests/ci/data/agent_sdk_python_baseline.json:3; the spec must align those lists and capability fields with tests/agent/sdk/python and the current task gates (spec/layerx-merge/spec.kvx:352017 and spec/layerx-merge/spec.kvx:352048), retaining collection of services/agent/sdk/python/tests for its baseline hook (services/agent/sdk/python/tests/conftest.py:20) as decision 2895 requires (spec/layerx-merge/spec.kvx:10485)."
close_comment = "The completed SDK repairs use tests/agent/sdk/python, but their declared test lists and capability metadata still point to the former locations. Correct those specification fields to match the existing test files and task gates, preserving collection of the sibling SDK suite and its baseline hook."
